--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
Lazy-wave power cable free in torsion, deck mesh too coarse at touchdown
-- The cable of lazy_wave_touchdown_torsion_coarse.dat free in torsion, so its static solve runs in
-- the vertical plane of the line. On the coarse deck mesh (10 m elements along the grounded run,
-- half the bending length is 2.5 m) that planar state is unstable out of its plane, and the dynamics
-- would start from it with the line free to leave the plane: the driver names it in a note, once,
-- and solves the deck unchanged.
